{"name":"定价区","description":"定价区是把多个套餐的价格、权益和适用对象并列比较的页面区块 · 定价区让用户比较不同方案适合谁、包含哪些权益以及实际要付多少。套餐数量应反映真实需求差异，并明确币种、计费周期、本次应付总额、税费、试用和取消规则；推荐标记必须有适用条件或数据依据，也不要设置缺乏真实价值、只用于价格锚定的虚高档位。","quote":"做三档套餐并排对比，中间那档标个“最受欢迎”。","agentPrompt":"请检查定价区：每档写清适用对象、差异权益、币种、计费周期、本次实际总额、续费和取消规则。月均价不能替代年付总额；没有依据就移除“最受欢迎”，并验证手机上仍能比较关键差异。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-pricing\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>定价区<span>Pricing</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">做三档套餐并排对比，中间那档标个“最受欢迎”。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">定价区是把多个套餐的价格、权益和适用对象并列比较的页面区块</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>定价区让用户比较不同方案适合谁、包含哪些权益以及实际要付多少。套餐数量应反映真实需求差异，并明确币种、计费周期、本次应付总额、税费、试用和取消规则；推荐标记必须有适用条件或数据依据，也不要设置缺乏真实价值、只用于价格锚定的虚高档位。</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo responsive-detail-demo site-detail-demo\" style=\"--detail-demo-width:560px\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"pricing-demo pricing-demo-col\"><small style=\"display:block;color:var(--text-3)\">虚构示例 · 上线时填入实际价格、总价与规则</small>\n    <div class=\"pricing-d-toggle\"><b class=\"on\">按月付费</b><b>按年付费 <em>显示年付总价</em></b></div>\n    <div class=\"pricing-d-row\">\n      <div class=\"pricing-card\">\n        <b class=\"pricing-tier\">免费版</b><span class=\"pricing-price\">¥0<small>/月</small></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-feats\"><i>✓ 10 个项目</i><i>✓ 100 次生成 / 月</i><i>✓ 社区支持</i></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-btn ghost\">开始使用</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pricing-card hot\">\n        <span class=\"pricing-badge\">适合高频使用者</span>\n        <b class=\"pricing-tier\">专业版</b><span class=\"pricing-price\">¥49<small>/月</small></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-feats\"><i>✓ 不限项目</i><i>✓ 自定义域名</i><i>✓ 优先支持</i></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-btn\">升级专业版</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pricing-card\">\n        <b class=\"pricing-tier\">团队版</b><span class=\"pricing-price\">¥199<small>/月</small></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-feats\"><i>✓ 多人协作</i><i>✓ 权限管理</i><i>✓ 专属客服</i></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-btn ghost\">联系销售</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请检查定价区：每档写清适用对象、差异权益、币种、计费周期、本次实际总额、续费和取消规则。月均价不能替代年付总额；没有依据就移除“最受欢迎”，并验证手机上仍能比较关键差异。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">按用户分层选择<b>合适数量的档位</b>，不把三档当成固定模板</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:stretch;gap:5px\"><span style=\"flex:1;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:5px;background:var(--bg);padding:4px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px\"><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">入门</b><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">示例价格</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:5px;background:var(--bg-soft);padding:4px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px\"><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">协作</b><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">示例价格</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:5px;background:var(--bg);padding:4px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px\"><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">组织</b><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">联系报价</span></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">推荐档要写明<b>适用对象或数据依据</b>；没有依据时不加推荐标记</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">推荐方案</b><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">只在有使用数据或明确适用条件时标注，并说明依据</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">同时写清<b>月付、年付总价与取消规则</b>，让用户比较实际成本</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">月付价格</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">年付总价</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">每个可购买或可试用的档位都应有<b>清楚的下一步</b>：可以是 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/cta?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"cta\" aria-label=\"CTA\">CTA</a>、联系销售或当前方案状态，不必机械放相同按钮</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px\"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:3px 7px\">开始免费版</span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:3px 7px\">升级专业版</span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">设置过多相似档位会<b>增加比较成本</b>，应合并无法清楚区分的方案</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"gap:3px\"><span style=\"width:16px;height:22px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:var(--bg)\"></span><span style=\"width:16px;height:22px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:var(--bg)\"></span><span style=\"width:16px;height:22px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:var(--bg)\"></span><span style=\"width:16px;height:22px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:var(--bg)\"></span><span style=\"width:16px;height:22px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:var(--bg)\"></span><span style=\"width:16px;height:22px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:var(--bg)\"></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">标准化个人方案通常应<b>直接说明价格</b>；只有需要评估范围的复杂方案才适合询价</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><span class=\"mk-btn outline\" style=\"align-self:flex-start;font-size:12px\">联系销售获取报价</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>预先勾选</b>付费加购项会改变用户选择，应让用户主动确认</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i><span style=\"font-size:12px\">加购专属客服 ¥30/月</span></span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\" style=\"align-self:flex-start\">立即支付 ¥79</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">首期价格、<b>续费价格和期限</b>都应放在用户容易注意的位置</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">¥9.9/月</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3)\">* 仅限首月，次月恢复 ¥99，需承诺在网 24 个月</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><div class=\"pricing-anat\">\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"tier\"><span class=\"pricing-anat-tier\">专业版</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"price\"><span class=\"pricing-anat-price\">¥49<small>/月</small></span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"features\"><span class=\"pricing-anat-feats\">不限项目 · 自定义域名 · 优先支持</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"cta\"><span class=\"pricing-anat-btn\">升级专业版</span></span>\n    </div></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"tier\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">档位卡</span><span class=\"pe\">Tier</span></button><span class=\"pd\">每档对应一类明确用户或使用范围</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"price\"><button 